<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Jan 2.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Jan 2.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL-AYAM</p>
<p>- An Asian worker killed, two injured as eight masked men set fire to a building in a Bahraini village.</p>
<p>- Bahrain to develop exhibition centre in 1997, commerce minister says.</p>
<p>AKHBAR ALKHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Bahrain Saudi Aluminum Marketing Company sold half a million tonnes of Alba's aluminium in 1996.</p>
